+|---|---:|---:|
+| `NO_CONTACT` | 1 | 1 |
+| `DEFEND_OR_REJECT` | 1 | 1 |
+| `BREAK_THROUGH_OR_ACCEPT` | 2 | 2 |
+| `UNRESOLVED_OR_AMBIGUOUS` | 5 | 5 |
+
+These technical labels are descriptive attrition facts. They are not
